---
const es = Astro.props.lang === "es";
const personalImageAlt = "Fabrizzio Castro"
---

<article class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-8 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 md:flex-row">
  <div
    class="[&>p]:mb-4 [&>p>strong]:text-blue-500 dark:[&>p>strong]:text-blue-100 [&>p>strong]:font-normal [&>p>strong]:font-mono text-pretty order-2 md:order-1"
  >
    <p>
      {es ? <>Soy Fabrizzio, aunque mis amigos me dicen «Bate». Toco batería y empecé a programar en 2021 con PSeInt y C++. Actualmente desarrollo proyectos de integración de información empresarial y <strong>colaboro con equipos de distintas áreas</strong>.</> : <>
      My name is Fabrizzio but my friends call me "Bate", I am a drummer, I started programming since 2021 at PSEINT and C++
      . I am currently developing business information integration projects.  
      <strong>Collaborating with teams from different areas, maintaining active communication</strong>.</>}
    </p>

    <p>
      {es ? <>He diseñado arquitecturas de software para <strong>Ascensores SA</strong> y participado en integraciones con <strong>SAP y OfficeTrack</strong>.</> : <>
      Some of my achievements are designing software architectures for <strong>Ascensores SA</strong>, 
      participating in integrations of tools from multinational companies such as <strong>SAP and OfficeTrack</strong>.</>}
    </p>

    <p>
      {es ? "Toco batería en la banda" : "I play drums in the band"} <strong>
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=huwlUCRgPe8&list=OLAK5uy_mfTrgO4Ex-3jARgWyz2l2BJ21mqZRxizE">
          Dawey
        </a></strong>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <img width="200" height="200" src="/img/fabrizzio-playa.jpg" alt={personalImageAlt} class="order-1 object-cover w-64 h-full p-1 md:order-2 rotate-3 lg:p-2 lg:w-64 aspect-square rounded-2xl bg-black/20 dark:bg-yellow-500/5 ring-1 ring-black/70 dark:ring-white/20 " style="object-position: 50% 50%">

</article>